WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,450
not me

2
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,300
My friend is mentally challenged and is unconscious now. Okay.

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,500
How does it compare with Tianqixing?

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,100
How about we go back to Tianqixing? I understand.

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,880
Where did that child come from?

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,180
The girl in the zebra hood

7
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,180
It's the eldest lady of Yida Technology and that Jin Yun

8
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,280
He is the son of squad leader Jian Shen

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,180
You're talking about the brief review squad leader

10
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:18,380
He can't be the squad leader of the Federal Supreme Court, right? That Madarai guy?

11
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:19,880
He doesn't seem to have any special identity

12
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,680
He's just the second-placed individual soldier in the 701st grade.

13
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:25,180
Is this competition that important to him? Why don't you work hard? Just calm down.

14
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:26,580
Mental competition is a good thing

15
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:27,680
It's a good thing if you succeed

16
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,780
shut your crow's mouth

17
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:29,880
What happened to you just now?

18
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:32,180
Sorry for scaring you

19
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:36,880
Are you Huang Yan?

20
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:39,180
The mecha master who fainted was Wang Tianwei

21
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:42,680
I watched your freshmen training live broadcast and forgot to introduce myself.

22
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,280
I am Mr. Yi from District 9

23
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:45,980
Currently serving as a major in the district

24
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:48,080
Subsequently, he insisted on completing the freshman training

25
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,980
District 9 has been watching you too.
